**P7 — READ/DERIVED:** Translation with VA ≠ PA is reachable through the existing SAPR/BWP interfaces and BATC lookup. Calling it unreachable would be wrong. Under the quoted bounded rules it is disclosure debt, rather than a compulsory new floor row. Explicitly reconcile this conclusion with Astra’s broader “required observations” wording; do not imply that observation was performed.

